 four-spoke red metal valve wheel with a central polished brass rivet. The wheel features a smooth, saturated red finish with soft ambient occlusion in the crevices and a subtle warm rim light on the upper-right edge., Soda0d=A horizontal, cylindrical copper steam capsule with two chunky brass arrow plates bolted to its left and right sides. The asset features a soft, semi-glossy finish with warm ambient occlusion and no outlines, clearly communicating its horizontal function through its physical shape., Soda90=A vertical, stubby copper steam capsule with two chunky brass arrow plates bolted to its top and bottom ends. The capsule is rendered as a clean, rounded 3D shape with smooth gradients and a distinct top-right rim light emphasizing its vertical orientation., Yel=A thick, chunky yellow gear with simplified teeth and a central brass washer. The gear is rendered in warm, saturated yellow with smooth, hand-painted gradients, soft AO shading, and no harsh outlines to ensure optimal 70px readability.
